\title{Rezk’s nerve is a model for #{∞}-localization}
\taxon{Reference}
\author\literal{Pedro Boavida}
\date{2019-08}
\meta{external}{https://www.math.tecnico.ulisboa.pt/~pbrito/rezk-loc29aug2019.pdf}

\subtree{
\taxon{Abstract}
\p{
We give a direct proof that Rezk’s nerve is a model for the #{∞}-localization of a
category with respect to a set of weak equivalences.
}
}

